@@s003 <span class="blob">AlgDes</span>
@@s004 atlas of Algorithm Design
@@s005 Seven ways to attack a problem that seems impossible: <b>enumerate everything</b>, <b>choose greedily</b>, <b>split in half</b>, <b>remember the subproblems</b>, <b>push a flow through</b>, and when nothing works, <b>prove that it is hard for everyone</b>.
@@s006 The course on one screen
@@s007 Teachers
@@s008 Thore Husfeldt (responsible), Riko Jacob
