@@s010 Thursday 8–10, in person, not recorded
@@s011 Exercise sessions
@@s012 Thursday 10–12; from 11 we work on the Kattis problem of the week
@@s013 Book
@@s014 Kleinberg &amp; Tardos, <i>Algorithm Design</i> (2005, single edition), chapters 1–8 and section 13.5
