@@s021 How the atlas is made
@@s022 Every theory page has an <b>animated scene</b> (use Forward/Back or the keyboard arrows), the proofs step by step, the Java code explained line by line and a final quiz. The code has been compiled and run; where there is your own Kattis solution, that one is explained.
@@s023 Next deadlines
@@s024 Deliveries, tests, sessions and things to prepare, in date order. No ticks: the status depends only on today's date.
