@@s030 The pages
@@s031 The book
@@s032 Jon Kleinberg and Éva Tardos, <i>Algorithm Design</i>, Addison-Wesley 2005. <b>Single edition</b>, ISBN 978-0321295354 (in some reprints the order of the chapters is different).
@@s033 The exam covers chapters <b>1</b>, <b>3</b>, <b>4</b>, <b>5</b>, <b>6</b>, <b>7</b>, <b>8</b> and section <b>13.5</b>. Chapter 3 on graphs has no dedicated lecture but has an exam question of its own: <a href="teoria/basi-grafi.html">graphs, BFS and DFS</a>.
@@s034 Buy it on paper
@@s035 As no electronic devices are allowed, a PDF at the exam is of no use.
